    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n99959" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεκ-πέμπω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>send out</i> or <i>forth together</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς ἀχρείους εἰς Πελλήνην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					7.2.18
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς οἰκέτας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Oec.</u>
					7.35
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ἅμ᾽ αὐτοῖς -θέντων ἐπὶ
					Θερμοπύλας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					11.4
				</span></i>
			; <i>help to get away</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Brut.</u>
				45
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Mar.</u>
				40
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of things,
				<i>send forth</i> or <i>eject together</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ πῶμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					91a
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φωνήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Anon.
				</span></i>
			 ap.<i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιμοῖ</span>
			.</div>
